{"code":0,"msg":"获取成功","time":"2026-09-17 18:02:41","data":{"id":"1ab13300-db6e-62ea-854b-8cb40dc1e8eb","com_id":"b732a092-0674-427d-bbad-dab183751cb1","job_id":"6a788f31-2ac7-c312-13f9-b3cc0f5bdd86","school_id":"1917e634-eee1-1358-537d-7e36f6f41777","addtime":1789367410,"istop":2,"complaint":0,"resume_count":0,"work_name":"美丽中国支教项目2027级项目老师（广西壮族自治区）","schoolwarn":"","remarks":"<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"center\"><a name=\"_Hlk207121488\"><\/a><strong><span =\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">美丽中国2027级支教项目老师招募简章<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">这是一份两年的志愿服务经历，简单而充实，让你看见乡村孩子的成长，见证自己的蜕变：<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">关于美丽中国支教项目<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">美丽中国支教项目创立于2008年，目前是北京立德未来助学公益基金会下设的教育非营利项目。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">秉持<strong><span =\"color: red;\">&ldquo;以学生为中心&rdquo; &ldquo;相信可能&rdquo; &ldquo;守正创新&rdquo; &ldquo;美美与共&rdquo;<\/span><\/strong>的核心价值观，通过项目老师&ldquo;服务学习&rdquo;的模式，让项目老师实现学生成长目标的同时，也能在志愿服务过程中加深对乡村教育的理解，并获得个人成长和能力提升，实现<strong><span =\"color: red;\">&ldquo;育人，遇自己&rdquo;<\/span><\/strong>，进而长期发力促进美丽中国愿景的实现。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>项目使命：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">在立足乡土、面向未来的服务学习中培养优秀青年人才，致力于长期推动中国教育均衡发展。最终实现美丽中国的愿景：<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span =\"color: red;\">&ldquo;让所有中国孩子，无论出身，都能获得同等的优质教育。&rdquo;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">基金会发起人寄语：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;在人们普遍讨论信仰缺失的今天，我在这群年轻人身上看到了希望，他们扛起一面旗帜，叫&lsquo;社会责任感&rsquo;。美丽中国相信教育不均可以并且必须得到解决。所有的中国孩子，无论出身，都应该获得同等的优质教育。我觉得美丽中国帮我找到了人生的价值和意义，我希望以后不要介绍我是什么人，只说一句：我在美丽中国工作过，就够了。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;刘泽彭<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">北京立德未来助学公益基金会发起人、名誉理事长<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">中共中央组织部原副秘书长、副部长，国务院侨务办公室原副主任<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">第十一届全国政协常委<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>申请要求：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1、具备本科或以上学历，并在2027年8月前获得毕业证、学位证，专业不限。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2、热爱祖国，拥护党的领导。认可美丽中国的愿景、使命和价值观。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0f4761;\">3<\/span><span =\"color: #0f4761;\">、<\/span>具有良好的适应性、学习能力、沟通能力、问题解决能力。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>支教时间：<\/strong>2027年8月-2029年7月<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>岗位地点：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">广西壮族自治区、云南省、广东省。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">广西壮族自治区  南宁、百色、来宾等地区<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">云南省  大理、临沧、保山、楚雄等地区<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">广东省  潮州、梅州、清远等地区<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">申请时，你可以选择自己的意向服务省。想了解项目地的详细信息，请<a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"http:\/\/www.meilizhongguo.org\/project-impact\"><span class=\"16\"><span =\"font-family: 等线;\">点击此处<\/span><\/span><\/a>。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>申请流程：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">提交申请：提交申请表，完成网申；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">参加面试：参加现场或网络面试；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">接受录取：面试后一周内，收到拟录取通知；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">入职准备：完成入职手续，参与入职活动，通过上岗培训。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: red;\">人生高光时刻不多，这可能是其中一个，网申链接：<a href=\"https:\/\/jinshuju.com\/f\/dn1mFE?x_field_1=%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A-%E6%8B%9B%E5%8B%9F%E7%AE%80%E7%AB%A0\">https:\/\/jinshuju.com\/f\/dn1mFE?x_field_1=%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A-%E6%8B%9B%E5%8B%9F%E7%AE%80%E7%AB%A0<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #ee0000;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">在美丽中国，你的职责：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">完成教学任务，包括不限于科学\/英语\/音乐\/体育\/美术等，如备课、上课、课程评价、教研活动，助力乡村学校开足开齐开好义务教育阶段课程。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">探索创新教育，设计课内外活动，开展项目式学习，如CSTEM、戏剧教育，培养乡村学生具备文化基础、自主发展、社会参与的核心素养。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">策划公益项目，调动整合社会资源，协同当地力量共创，从学校辐射到乡村社区，积极参与乡村振兴文化建设，助力当地教育生态良性循环。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">发挥长期影响，树立青年榜样，传播公益理念，支教结束后加入美丽中国校友网络，持续关注和反哺乡村教育，推动中国教育优质均衡发展。<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #ee0000;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">在美丽中国，你将收获：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">乡土中国一线实践：两年扎根乡村，感受祖国基层，践行乡村振兴的光荣使命。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">系统服务学习历练：美丽中国培训，乡村学校实践，积累教育公益经验和方法。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">领导管理能力提升：操盘公益项目，从策划到复盘，培养系统思维和全局观念。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">职业生涯沉淀发展：行业大咖分享，校友导师交流，拓展人际圈助力未来发展。<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">在美丽中国，你的保障：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>安心的生活保障<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1）安全环境：学校通常在县城周边或乡镇中心，邻近派出所和医院；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2）免费安居：学校内免费住宿，通网络和水电；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">3）便捷生活：学校有食堂\/厨房，就餐便利。所在乡镇，公交和快递可达。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"2\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>稳定的财务保障<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">人均每年5万+元综合保障，包括不限于：<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1）补贴：岗前培训补贴（3000元\/次）、月度生活补贴（3000元\/月）；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2）交通报销：寒暑假返乡探亲或社会实践的交通报销（上限4800元\/学年）；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">3）各类奖励：获教师资格证、获得年度优秀项目老师、圆满完成两年服务，均可获得奖励金。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">注：1）具体支持以2027-2028学年《项目老师保障支持方案》为准。2）美丽中国将依法代扣代缴所涉及到的个人所得税。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"3\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>全面的健康支持<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1）身心健康：年度体检、EAP外呼关怀、在线心理咨询、身心健康辅导课程。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2）商业保险：一般意外伤害、交通工具意外伤害、疾病身故、重大疾病、综合医疗（含门急诊、住院）、住院津贴。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"4\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>丰富的假期时间<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">国家法定节假日、寒暑假、部分少数民族地方假期。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">项目影响力<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: black;\">影响乡村孩子的生命轨迹<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">18<\/span><span =\"color: black;\">年来，美丽中国走进5个省55个县540多所乡村学校，影响120万+人次乡村孩子的生命轨迹。2025-2026学年，88%的合作学校校长告诉我们，项目老师的到来，提升了学生的学习兴趣和积极性。这背后，是项目老师开展的250多个素养教育项目，覆盖艺术、科学、健康等多个领域，让乡村孩子绽放更多可能。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #f4b183;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;我原本是一位再平常不过的小女孩，却有幸被我的英语老师&mdash;&mdash;林老师，带进了神奇的童话世界。在那里，我变成了墙、小矮人&hellip;&hellip;体验了许多角色的生命旅程，也体会到故事中人物在不同情境下的感受，比如当白雪公主&ldquo;死&rdquo;去时，小矮人们是多么伤心&hellip;&hellip;谢谢林老师让我学到更多、感受更多。我期待下一次还能与您一起再度走进童话世界。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;布语彤<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">云南省临沧市云县大寨镇大寨完小五年级学生<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"2\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: black;\">助力青年志愿者的职业蜕变<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">18<\/span><span =\"color: black;\">年来，4000多名大学毕业生加入美丽中国，扎根基层，在志愿服务中学习成长。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">通过专业人才测评显示，刚完成两年项目的年轻人，在自省与学习力、职业素养、责任与执行力、探索与创新力、影响感召力五个方面，个人水平，显著提升。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">据统计，这些年轻人完成支教后，奔赴教育、公益、政府、商业组织工作，以及高校深造。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">42% <\/span><span =\"color: black;\">任职于学校等教育机构，如深圳湾学校、云谷学校、爱文世界学校、华发教育集团。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">33% <\/span><span =\"color: black;\">就职于各类企业，如腾讯、哔哩哔哩、美团、科大讯飞、欧莱雅、太古可口可乐。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">12% <\/span>投身至公益组织，如浙江省爱心教育基金会、中国初级卫生保健基金会、马云公益基金会。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">5% <\/span>进入到政府部门，如教育部、云南省人民政府办公厅、山东省办公厅。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">5% <\/span>继续到高校深造，如北京大学、北京师范大学、东北师范大学、香港大学、伦敦政治经济学院。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">3% <\/span>开启了自主创业，如创办了&ldquo;是光诗歌&rdquo;、亿企云科技、禾沐体育。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;2026年7月距离我启程去支教已经十一年了，也是我踏入公益行业的第十一年。这些年间，从身体力行、感动自己；到深耕项目、带动他人；再到跨界链接、影响行业。美丽中国的长期影响力始终指引着我，孩子们的恣意成长也不断激励着我。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;孙权赵峰<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;<\/span><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">毕业于复旦大学\/美丽中国2015级校友<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">曾支教于广东省潮州市饶平县苗田小学<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">现就职于阿里巴巴公益基金会<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"3\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: black;\">放大社会资源的力量<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">18<\/span><span =\"color: black;\">年来，我们整合社会资源，凝聚了推动中国教育均衡发展的多重力量：<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有不忘初心的众多校友，和我们一起坚守，共同将两年热忱化为长期影响。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有默默耕耘的本地老师，与我们彼此成就，共同守护一代代乡村孩子梦想。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有慷慨支持的爱心人士，为我们注入动力，共同支持项目老师育人遇自己。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有提供就业岗位的雇主，解我们后顾之忧，共同助力项目老师的职业发展。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #c55a11;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;<\/span><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">本科毕业后，在留学和工作的纠结后，我最后选择加入美丽中国走进了云南的一所乡村中学。那两年，我真正理解了\"Teaching as Leadership\"和\"教育公平\"的分量：它不是一个口号，而是每一节课、每一次组织活动、每一次与学生的谈话。乡村讲台教会我的，远比我教给学生的多&mdash;&mdash;如何在资源有限的环境中把事情做成，如何跨越文化和背景的差异去建立信任。十多年过去，美丽中国给我的，是一份至今仍在支撑我职业信念的初心和原点。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;<\/span><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">姜厚明<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">毕业于厦门大学\/哥伦比亚大学\/香港大学\/美丽中国2012级校友<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">曾支教于云南省保山市龙陵县龙陵二中<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">现就职于北京市鼎石学校任初中部校长<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>媒体报道 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【中国青年报】从北京到双江，这名支教女孩为另一名女孩推开梦想之窗 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/s.cyol.com\/articles\/2026-03\/17\/content_ajAANlsz.html\">点击阅读<\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【澎湃新闻】美丽中国首张乡村儿童原创音乐专辑上线 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/m.thepaper.cn\/newsDetail_forward_32398028\">点击阅读<\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【联合国新闻】公平的优质教育让世界更加美好 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/news.un.org\/zh\/audio\/2024\/01\/1126067\"><span class=\"15\">点击阅读<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【新华社】《育人遇自己：一场大山里的教育接力》新书发布会在京举办 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/h.xinhuaxmt.com\/vh512\/share\/11679108?d=134b301&amp;channel=weixin\"><span class=\"15\">点击阅读<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span class=\"15\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>出版物<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2023年，中央党校出版集团出版美丽中国支教项目十五周年纪实文学作品《育人遇自己》。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2018年，广西师范大学出版社出版美丽中国支教项目十周年纪实文学作品《微光&middot;炬火》。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>所获荣誉<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2025年底，美丽中国支教项目在澎湃新闻主办的&ldquo;责任与共 向新而行&rdquo;责任践行者年会&ldquo;年度责任践行公益项目&rdquo;奖。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2025年，北京立德未来助学公益基金会党支部被上级党委评为&ldquo;2025年度先进党支部&rdquo;。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2024年，美丽中国支教项目荣获由《中国慈善家》与新浪微博联合举办的&ldquo;恒心至善&middot;年度慈善盛典&rdquo;年度乡村振兴贡献奖。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2023年，北京立德未来助学公益基金会被北京市民政局评为4A级社会组织。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>联系方式：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">电话：010-65015421<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">公众号：查找&ldquo;美丽中国招募&rdquo;或下方扫码<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">官方网站：www.meilizhongguo.org<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><a><img src=\"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2026\/08\/31\/1788144699-665976acef-98d7-805f-a907-9a003110fbf7.jpg!y\" alt=\"\/tmp\/webword_1849164087\/upload_post__v2_1499884185\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a><\/p>","isdeliver":1,"status":1,"jobInfo":{"id":"6a788f31-2ac7-c312-13f9-b3cc0f5bdd86","jobtype":1,"work_name":"美丽中国支教项目2027级项目老师（广西壮族自治区）","dalei_id":"77098846-ef88-b0b0-0481-dc469aeb77e0","cate_id1":"c7092ffc-ee0d-835b-1a8f-a928f9859878","cate_id2":"fa9557d1-e5b4-52d7-b451-1c30da10ce2f","province_id":45,"city_id":4510,"district_id":0,"isday":0,"salary_floor":3000,"salay_ceil":3999,"status":1,"create_id":"2650bd91-bd27-4826-a151-a19f2231e567","addtime":1788144734,"person_count":"5人","com_id":"b732a092-0674-427d-bbad-dab183751cb1","com_id_name":"北京立德未来助学公益基金会","label":"","xueli_id":"3cc6e5cf-0b81-7e83-8322-fe0273871ab0","laiyuan":2,"sharetype":0,"viewcount":107,"complaint":0,"work_days":"","practice_month":"","chance":3,"isedit":2,"resume_count":0,"expire_time":0,"address":"广西壮族自治区南宁、百色、来宾等地区乡镇公立学校","start_time":0,"end_time":0,"teacher_business":"","refresh_time":0,"is_del":2,"is_expire":1,"exposure":0,"wm_id":null,"certificate":"","job_id":"6a788f31-2ac7-c312-13f9-b3cc0f5bdd86","remarks":"<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"center\"><a name=\"_Hlk207121488\"><\/a><strong><span =\"font-size: 16.0pt;\">美丽中国2027级支教项目老师招募简章<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">这是一份两年的志愿服务经历，简单而充实，让你看见乡村孩子的成长，见证自己的蜕变：<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">关于美丽中国支教项目<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">美丽中国支教项目创立于2008年，目前是北京立德未来助学公益基金会下设的教育非营利项目。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">秉持<strong><span =\"color: red;\">&ldquo;以学生为中心&rdquo; &ldquo;相信可能&rdquo; &ldquo;守正创新&rdquo; &ldquo;美美与共&rdquo;<\/span><\/strong>的核心价值观，通过项目老师&ldquo;服务学习&rdquo;的模式，让项目老师实现学生成长目标的同时，也能在志愿服务过程中加深对乡村教育的理解，并获得个人成长和能力提升，实现<strong><span =\"color: red;\">&ldquo;育人，遇自己&rdquo;<\/span><\/strong>，进而长期发力促进美丽中国愿景的实现。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>项目使命：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">在立足乡土、面向未来的服务学习中培养优秀青年人才，致力于长期推动中国教育均衡发展。最终实现美丽中国的愿景：<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: center; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"center\"><strong><span =\"color: red;\">&ldquo;让所有中国孩子，无论出身，都能获得同等的优质教育。&rdquo;<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">基金会发起人寄语：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;在人们普遍讨论信仰缺失的今天，我在这群年轻人身上看到了希望，他们扛起一面旗帜，叫&lsquo;社会责任感&rsquo;。美丽中国相信教育不均可以并且必须得到解决。所有的中国孩子，无论出身，都应该获得同等的优质教育。我觉得美丽中国帮我找到了人生的价值和意义，我希望以后不要介绍我是什么人，只说一句：我在美丽中国工作过，就够了。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;刘泽彭<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">北京立德未来助学公益基金会发起人、名誉理事长<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">中共中央组织部原副秘书长、副部长，国务院侨务办公室原副主任<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">第十一届全国政协常委<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>申请要求：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1、具备本科或以上学历，并在2027年8月前获得毕业证、学位证，专业不限。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2、热爱祖国，拥护党的领导。认可美丽中国的愿景、使命和价值观。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0f4761;\">3<\/span><span =\"color: #0f4761;\">、<\/span>具有良好的适应性、学习能力、沟通能力、问题解决能力。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>支教时间：<\/strong>2027年8月-2029年7月<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>岗位地点：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">广西壮族自治区、云南省、广东省。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">广西壮族自治区  南宁、百色、来宾等地区<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">云南省  大理、临沧、保山、楚雄等地区<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">广东省  潮州、梅州、清远等地区<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">申请时，你可以选择自己的意向服务省。想了解项目地的详细信息，请<a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"http:\/\/www.meilizhongguo.org\/project-impact\"><span class=\"16\"><span =\"font-family: 等线;\">点击此处<\/span><\/span><\/a>。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>申请流程：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">提交申请：提交申请表，完成网申；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">参加面试：参加现场或网络面试；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">接受录取：面试后一周内，收到拟录取通知；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">入职准备：完成入职手续，参与入职活动，通过上岗培训。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: red;\">人生高光时刻不多，这可能是其中一个，网申链接：<a href=\"https:\/\/jinshuju.com\/f\/dn1mFE?x_field_1=%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A-%E6%8B%9B%E5%8B%9F%E7%AE%80%E7%AB%A0\">https:\/\/jinshuju.com\/f\/dn1mFE?x_field_1=%E7%BA%BF%E4%B8%8A-%E6%8B%9B%E5%8B%9F%E7%AE%80%E7%AB%A0<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #ee0000;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">在美丽中国，你的职责：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">完成教学任务，包括不限于科学\/英语\/音乐\/体育\/美术等，如备课、上课、课程评价、教研活动，助力乡村学校开足开齐开好义务教育阶段课程。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">探索创新教育，设计课内外活动，开展项目式学习，如CSTEM、戏剧教育，培养乡村学生具备文化基础、自主发展、社会参与的核心素养。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">策划公益项目，调动整合社会资源，协同当地力量共创，从学校辐射到乡村社区，积极参与乡村振兴文化建设，助力当地教育生态良性循环。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">发挥长期影响，树立青年榜样，传播公益理念，支教结束后加入美丽中国校友网络，持续关注和反哺乡村教育，推动中国教育优质均衡发展。<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #ee0000;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">在美丽中国，你将收获：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">乡土中国一线实践：两年扎根乡村，感受祖国基层，践行乡村振兴的光荣使命。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">系统服务学习历练：美丽中国培训，乡村学校实践，积累教育公益经验和方法。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">领导管理能力提升：操盘公益项目，从策划到复盘，培养系统思维和全局观念。<\/li>\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">职业生涯沉淀发展：行业大咖分享，校友导师交流，拓展人际圈助力未来发展。<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">在美丽中国，你的保障：<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>安心的生活保障<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1）安全环境：学校通常在县城周边或乡镇中心，邻近派出所和医院；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2）免费安居：学校内免费住宿，通网络和水电；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">3）便捷生活：学校有食堂\/厨房，就餐便利。所在乡镇，公交和快递可达。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"2\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>稳定的财务保障<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">人均每年5万+元综合保障，包括不限于：<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1）补贴：岗前培训补贴（3000元\/次）、月度生活补贴（3000元\/月）；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2）交通报销：寒暑假返乡探亲或社会实践的交通报销（上限4800元\/学年）；<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">3）各类奖励：获教师资格证、获得年度优秀项目老师、圆满完成两年服务，均可获得奖励金。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">注：1）具体支持以2027-2028学年《项目老师保障支持方案》为准。2）美丽中国将依法代扣代缴所涉及到的个人所得税。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"3\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>全面的健康支持<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">1）身心健康：年度体检、EAP外呼关怀、在线心理咨询、身心健康辅导课程。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2）商业保险：一般意外伤害、交通工具意外伤害、疾病身故、重大疾病、综合医疗（含门急诊、住院）、住院津贴。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"4\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>丰富的假期时间<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">国家法定节假日、寒暑假、部分少数民族地方假期。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">项目影响力<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: black;\">影响乡村孩子的生命轨迹<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">18<\/span><span =\"color: black;\">年来，美丽中国走进5个省55个县540多所乡村学校，影响120万+人次乡村孩子的生命轨迹。2025-2026学年，88%的合作学校校长告诉我们，项目老师的到来，提升了学生的学习兴趣和积极性。这背后，是项目老师开展的250多个素养教育项目，覆盖艺术、科学、健康等多个领域，让乡村孩子绽放更多可能。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #f4b183;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;我原本是一位再平常不过的小女孩，却有幸被我的英语老师&mdash;&mdash;林老师，带进了神奇的童话世界。在那里，我变成了墙、小矮人&hellip;&hellip;体验了许多角色的生命旅程，也体会到故事中人物在不同情境下的感受，比如当白雪公主&ldquo;死&rdquo;去时，小矮人们是多么伤心&hellip;&hellip;谢谢林老师让我学到更多、感受更多。我期待下一次还能与您一起再度走进童话世界。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;布语彤<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">云南省临沧市云县大寨镇大寨完小五年级学生<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"2\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: black;\">助力青年志愿者的职业蜕变<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">18<\/span><span =\"color: black;\">年来，4000多名大学毕业生加入美丽中国，扎根基层，在志愿服务中学习成长。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">通过专业人才测评显示，刚完成两年项目的年轻人，在自省与学习力、职业素养、责任与执行力、探索与创新力、影响感召力五个方面，个人水平，显著提升。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">据统计，这些年轻人完成支教后，奔赴教育、公益、政府、商业组织工作，以及高校深造。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">42% <\/span><span =\"color: black;\">任职于学校等教育机构，如深圳湾学校、云谷学校、爱文世界学校、华发教育集团。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">33% <\/span><span =\"color: black;\">就职于各类企业，如腾讯、哔哩哔哩、美团、科大讯飞、欧莱雅、太古可口可乐。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">12% <\/span>投身至公益组织，如浙江省爱心教育基金会、中国初级卫生保健基金会、马云公益基金会。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">5% <\/span>进入到政府部门，如教育部、云南省人民政府办公厅、山东省办公厅。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">5% <\/span>继续到高校深造，如北京大学、北京师范大学、东北师范大学、香港大学、伦敦政治经济学院。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">3% <\/span>开启了自主创业，如创办了&ldquo;是光诗歌&rdquo;、亿企云科技、禾沐体育。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;2026年7月距离我启程去支教已经十一年了，也是我踏入公益行业的第十一年。这些年间，从身体力行、感动自己；到深耕项目、带动他人；再到跨界链接、影响行业。美丽中国的长期影响力始终指引着我，孩子们的恣意成长也不断激励着我。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;孙权赵峰<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;<\/span><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">毕业于复旦大学\/美丽中国2015级校友<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">曾支教于广东省潮州市饶平县苗田小学<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">现就职于阿里巴巴公益基金会<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ol =\"margin-bottom: 0cm; margin-top: 0px;\" start=\"3\">\n<li =\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0px; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong><span =\"color: black;\">放大社会资源的力量<\/span><\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">18<\/span><span =\"color: black;\">年来，我们整合社会资源，凝聚了推动中国教育均衡发展的多重力量：<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有不忘初心的众多校友，和我们一起坚守，共同将两年热忱化为长期影响。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有默默耕耘的本地老师，与我们彼此成就，共同守护一代代乡村孩子梦想。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有慷慨支持的爱心人士，为我们注入动力，共同支持项目老师育人遇自己。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: black;\">有提供就业岗位的雇主，解我们后顾之忧，共同助力项目老师的职业发展。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #c55a11;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&ldquo;<\/span><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">本科毕业后，在留学和工作的纠结后，我最后选择加入美丽中国走进了云南的一所乡村中学。那两年，我真正理解了\"Teaching as Leadership\"和\"教育公平\"的分量：它不是一个口号，而是每一节课、每一次组织活动、每一次与学生的谈话。乡村讲台教会我的，远比我教给学生的多&mdash;&mdash;如何在资源有限的环境中把事情做成，如何跨越文化和背景的差异去建立信任。十多年过去，美丽中国给我的，是一份至今仍在支撑我职业信念的初心和原点。&rdquo;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&mdash;&mdash;<\/span><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">姜厚明<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">毕业于厦门大学\/哥伦比亚大学\/香港大学\/美丽中国2012级校友<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">曾支教于云南省保山市龙陵县龙陵二中<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: right; margin: 0cm; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\" align=\"right\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">现就职于北京市鼎石学校任初中部校长<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span =\"color: #0070c0;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>媒体报道 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【中国青年报】从北京到双江，这名支教女孩为另一名女孩推开梦想之窗 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/s.cyol.com\/articles\/2026-03\/17\/content_ajAANlsz.html\">点击阅读<\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【澎湃新闻】美丽中国首张乡村儿童原创音乐专辑上线 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/m.thepaper.cn\/newsDetail_forward_32398028\">点击阅读<\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【联合国新闻】公平的优质教育让世界更加美好 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/news.un.org\/zh\/audio\/2024\/01\/1126067\"><span class=\"15\">点击阅读<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">【新华社】《育人遇自己：一场大山里的教育接力》新书发布会在京举办 <a =\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https:\/\/h.xinhuaxmt.com\/vh512\/share\/11679108?d=134b301&amp;channel=weixin\"><span class=\"15\">点击阅读<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><span class=\"15\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>出版物<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2023年，中央党校出版集团出版美丽中国支教项目十五周年纪实文学作品《育人遇自己》。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2018年，广西师范大学出版社出版美丽中国支教项目十周年纪实文学作品《微光&middot;炬火》。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>所获荣誉<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2025年底，美丽中国支教项目在澎湃新闻主办的&ldquo;责任与共 向新而行&rdquo;责任践行者年会&ldquo;年度责任践行公益项目&rdquo;奖。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2025年，北京立德未来助学公益基金会党支部被上级党委评为&ldquo;2025年度先进党支部&rdquo;。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2024年，美丽中国支教项目荣获由《中国慈善家》与新浪微博联合举办的&ldquo;恒心至善&middot;年度慈善盛典&rdquo;年度乡村振兴贡献奖。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">2023年，北京立德未来助学公益基金会被北京市民政局评为4A级社会组织。<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><strong>联系方式：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">电话：010-65015421<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">公众号：查找&ldquo;美丽中国招募&rdquo;或下方扫码<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\">官方网站：www.meilizhongguo.org<\/p>\n<p =\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: 等线;\"><a><img src=\"\/\/jymnjep1.jiuyeb.cn\/2026\/08\/31\/1788144699-665976acef-98d7-805f-a907-9a003110fbf7.jpg!y\" alt=\"\/tmp\/webword_1849164087\/upload_post__v2_1499884185\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" \/><\/a><\/p>","tags":"0b4bfb54-44da-f94e-fdee-48306bcb1df7,1b00542f-2c2c-1531-c262-d297bc27a69f,b8010cd5-235e-096a-f1d6-1f5d1b4dbe74,f04752cc-87f4-a647-8bc5-e8c59b4a99fc,f5ce3486-761d-b405-c4a6-00f218d9c4b7","create_name":"","zhize":"","fangxiang":"","tagsList":[{"id":"0b4bfb54-44da-f94e-fdee-48306bcb1df7","title":"带薪寒暑假"},{"id":"1b00542f-2c2c-1531-c262-d297bc27a69f","title":"寒暑假"},{"id":"b8010cd5-235e-096a-f1d6-1f5d1b4dbe74","titl